                                        "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                        "entry_id": "b6b233c5-45ac-37d7-af00-856d1465a343",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of preacher's kid, pastor's kid, or priest's kid: the child of a clergyman and/or clergywoman, especially Protestant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43a1f0d1-8a41-45ea-ac90-a108fbdcf71d",
                                                "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                                "text": "1906, Association of Professors and Researchers in Religious Education, Religious Education\nThe traditional community image of the pk (preacher's kid) and the social control function of gossip in relation to the minister's wife underline the interlocking nature […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62a70353-c748-47fa-b5cc-15ea558d78e7",
                                                "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                                "text": "I was a typical PK (preacher's kid), full of mischief, full of life and insatiable curiosity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce388f93-b114-46fa-8281-e53a3841763e",
                                                "sense_id": "30bc23a0-d794-3d46-a77d-b13dc6b78992",
                                                "text": "And after all, I was a PK (preacher's kid) and no one wanted to play with a PK in any case! It might be catching, like the measles!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba702078-26e7-3e25-ac31-a69e4bd4b8b2",
                                        "entry_id": "b6b233c5-45ac-37d7-af00-856d1465a343",
